@startuml UC-63
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-63.md
title UC-63: View / Search Users
footer Feature AUSR-01 | Business rules: BR-02, BR-07
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "OData/UsersController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "UserService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

note over API : Requires role: Admin

U -> MVC : Search users by name or email, filter by role / status
MVC -> API : GET /odata/users?$filter=(contains(FullName,'{q}') or contains(Email,'{q}'))\n and Role eq '{role}' and Status eq '{status}'\n&$orderby=CreatedAt desc&$top=20&$count=true
API -> SVC : QueryUsers()
SVC --> API : IQueryable<UserListDto>\n(no PasswordHash or tokens) (BR-02)
API -> DB : Apply OData options and execute query
DB --> API : Matching users (+ total count)
API --> MVC : 200 OK
alt no match
  MVC --> U : Show empty list
else users found
  MVC --> U : Show users (name, email, role, status, registered)
end

@enduml
